#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_other_install.rst:5
#: 114547fd478441e289e405700407df86
msgid "3DR Solo - Initial ArduCopter Install Using Mission Planner & WinSCP"
msgstr "3DR Solo - 使用 Mission Planner 和WinSCP初始安装ArduCopter"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_other_install.rst:7
#: 9cd4fc30d3eb4ec39236f98d235a9e93
msgid ""
"These are detailed instructions for the installation of ArduCopter on the "
"3DR Solo using Mission Planner and WinSCP. **Your solo should be in safe "
"working order before you start**. It should not be malfunctioning or "
"unreliable before you even begin. It must be up to date with the latest 3DR "
"firmware. You cannot do this with a straight out of the box Solo. You must "
"go through the full pre-flight update first on a new Solo.  Once your Solo "
"is up to date and working well, you're ready to begin this process."
msgstr ""
"以下是在3DR Solo上使用 Mission Planner "
"和WinSCP安装ArduCopter的详细说明。**开始之前，您的Solo应处于安全可用的工作状态**。在开始之前，Solo不应存在故障或不可靠的情况。Solo必须更新到最新的3DR固件。您不能在刚开箱的Solo上执行此操作。新Solo必须先完成完整的飞行前更新。Solo更新完毕并正常工作后，您就可以开始此过程了。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_other_install.rst:9
#: ae90c9b26b9440cea15239723bb0f84d
msgid ""
"This method is somewhat complicated compared to using Solex. But this does "
"work. Please read carefully and follow all steps in order."
msgstr "与使用Solex相比，此方法相对复杂。但确实有效。请仔细阅读并按顺序完成所有步骤。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_other_install.rst:11
#: 69d3551cebe4406bbe29d02936a22531
msgid ""
"These instructions use `WinSCP <https://winscp.net/eng/download.php>`_ for "
"moving files to/from the companion computer and your PC. But the settings "
"and process are basically the same for `Filezilla <https://filezilla-"
"project.org/download.php?type=client>`_ and other SFTP applications.  The "
"settings and what the directory structures look like are pictured below."
msgstr ""
"这些说明使用 `WinSCP <https://winscp.net/eng/download.php>`_ "
"在伴飞计算机和PC之间传输文件。但设置和流程与 `Filezilla <https://filezilla-"
"project.org/download.php?type=client>`_ 及其他SFTP应用基本相同。设置和目录结构如下图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_other_install.rst:16
#: 33de7467dc654e7db3d83c0d98705435
msgid ""
"These instructions use :ref:`The Mission Planner <planner:install-mission-"
"planner>` ground station application for Windows. The necessary settings for"
" Mission Planner are pictured below. They are in the *Config/Tuning > "
"Planner* section. You need the *layout drop down* set for advanced and the "
"*connection drop* down set for UDP. To connect to the Solo, your PC must be "
"connected to the Solo's WiFi. To connect with Mission Planner, press the "
"connect button in upper right once you're ready. Mission Planner will "
"connect to the Solo's Pixhawk and download all its parameters. Once "
"connected, you will get many more options in config/tuning."
msgstr ""
"这些说明使用 :ref:`Mission Planner <planner:install-mission-planner>` "
"Windows地面站应用程序。Mission Planner 的必要设置如下图所示。它们位于 *Config/Tuning > Planner* "
"部分。您需要将 *布局下拉菜单* 设置为高级，*连接下拉菜单* "
"设置为UDP。要连接Solo，您的PC必须连接到Solo的WiFi。准备就绪后，按右上角的连接按钮与 Mission Planner "
"连接。Mission Planner 将连接到Solo的Pixhawk并下载所有参数。连接后，在config/tuning中会有更多选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_other_install.rst:21
#: 55e18a628a1048e8b3f6e8c93d6dd10b
msgid ""
"**Download the zip file** for the version you wish to install from the "
"`SoloScripts repository on GitHub "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/SoloScripts>`_. As of this writing, that is "
"``ArduCopter_3-5-0.zip``. Save this zip file somewhere convenient on your PC"
" and unzip it. In the zip, there are several files that will be used "
"throughout this process."
msgstr ""
"**下载zip文件**，从 `GitHub上的SoloScripts仓库 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/SoloScripts>`_ 下载您希望安装的版本。截至本文写作时，为 "
"``ArduCopter_3-5-0.zip``。将此zip文件保存到PC上的方便位置并解压。zip中包含整个过程中将使用的多个文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_other_install.rst:23
#: 869782e98a914657aa1dc1dec3034a46
msgid ""
"An ArduCopter firmware file. As of this writing, the file is "
"``AC350_Firmware.px4``."
msgstr "一个ArduCopter固件文件。截至本文写作时，文件为 ``AC350_Firmware.px4``。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_other_install.rst:24
#: a994a6b9f7334c4b9bb393e2f6c22628
msgid "A directory of python files (``*.py``)"
msgstr "一个包含python文件（``*.py``）的目录"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_other_install.rst:25
#: 8945a58cfc8b4fcd9762011c884c9e1a
msgid "A wipe firmware file called ``Wipe_Pixhawk_Firmware.px4``."
msgstr "一个名为 ``Wipe_Pixhawk_Firmware.px4`` 的清除固件文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_other_install.rst:28
#: 9a18d29a14d24a6cbf70efb7ef0482bd
msgid ""
"**1) Update python files before installing Pixhawk!** Before doing anything "
"else, you must load the new python files onto the Solo's companion computer."
" Use WinSCP, Filezilla, or other SFTP application as described in the "
"beginning.  Put all the python files (``*.py``) from the zip file into the "
"**/usr/bin/** directory on the Solo, overwriting the ones that are already "
"there. After copying the files, power cycle the solo. The files are compiled"
" on reboot. It will reconnect to the controller upon rebooting. It is "
"critical that this step take places **before** you install the Green Cube in"
" your solo!"
msgstr ""
"**1）安装Pixhawk前先更新python文件！** "
"在进行任何其他操作之前，必须将新的python文件加载到Solo的伴飞计算机上。如开头所述，使用WinSCP、Filezilla或其他SFTP应用。将zip文件中的所有python文件（``*.py``）放入Solo的"
" **/usr/bin/** "
"目录，覆盖已有文件。复制文件后，给Solo断电重启。文件将在重启时编译。重启后将重新连接到遥控器。此步骤必须在您将绿色Cube安装到Solo之 "
"**前** 完成！"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_other_install.rst:30
#: 008749e6b9d54341a13e86d9375ba226
msgid ""
"**3) Remove the battery tray:** Remove the battery and pop off the GPS "
"cover.  Then unscrew all the small black screws around the battery tray. The"
" battery tray can now be lifted up.  Carefully unplug the GPS from the "
"carrier board.  Set the battery tray aside."
msgstr ""
"**3) 取下电池托盘：** 取出电池并弹开 GPS 盖板，然后拧下电池托盘周围所有小黑螺丝。此时可以将电池托盘抬起。小心地将 GPS "
"从载板上拔下，将电池托盘放置一旁。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_other_install.rst:35
#: f0bdbd50eb264693a3973ec807ef2214
msgid ""
"**4) Lift up the carrier board:** Locate the comparatively large silver "
"screw on the right side toward the front. Unscrew that and set it aside with"
" all the other screws..  The carrier board can now be lifted up very "
"carefully.  You will need to fidget with the wires from the motor pods a "
"bit. Unplugging the front left motor pod from the carrier board can make "
"this easier. The board will need to go up a bit, then shift back, then shift"
" up the rest of the way. The left side can go up higher than the right, "
"which is convenient.  It's kind of tight and generally annoying.  Be careful"
" not to break the small wires.  Don't break any of the other wires either.  "
"You will need to get the board high enough up to expose the Pixhawk mounted "
"underneath it.  It's the black cube looking device."
msgstr ""
"**4) 抬起载板：** "
"找到右侧靠前位置那颗相对较大的银色螺丝，将其拧下并与其他螺丝放在一起。现在可以非常小心地将载板抬起。您可能需要稍微拨弄一下来自电机舱的导线。将左前方电机舱从载板上拔出可以使操作更方便。载板需要先向上抬起一点，再向后移动，然后继续向上抬到位。左侧可以比右侧抬得更高，这很方便。整个过程比较紧凑，操作起来有些麻烦。注意不要弄断细小的导线，其他导线也要小心。需要将载板抬得足够高，以露出安装在其下方的"
" Pixhawk，即那个看起来像黑色方块的设备。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_other_install.rst:42
#: 67697a2a486f4b38b44da3620198859f
msgid ""
"**5) Unscrew the stock Pixhawk:** There are 4 very small screws on the top "
"of the carrier board. Unscrew them and set them aside. The stock Pixhawk can"
" now be removed. It will pull down off the carrier board. Set the stock "
"Pixhawk aside somewhere safe. You will want to keep it."
msgstr ""
"**5）拆下原装Pixhawk：** "
"载板顶部有4个非常小的螺丝。拧下并放在一边。现在可以取出原装Pixhawk。它会从载板底部拉出。将原装Pixhawk放在安全的地方。您会希望保留它。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_other_install.rst:47
#: 44dc370bbec84c5cb8a136476078a4d9
msgid ""
"**6) Install the green cube:** The green cube installs the same way the old "
"one came off.  Plug it into the carrier board from the bottom.  Then put in "
"the four screws."
msgstr "**6) 安装绿色 Cube：** 绿色 Cube 的安装方式与旧 Cube 的拆除方式相同。从底部将其插入载板，然后装上四颗螺丝。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_other_install.rst:51
#: cf6b35a49fee4181a72d4b6dc0236cc7
msgid ""
"**Do not reassemble yet:** It is best to do the initial firmware install "
"with the Solo still opened up. If anything goes wrong, it avoids having to "
"disassemble it again."
msgstr "**暂勿重新组装：** 最好在 Solo 仍处于打开状态时进行初始固件安装。如果出现任何问题，可以避免再次拆解。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_other_install.rst:53
#: 0f4385f7bca24adea6fa90f3c5cf4a92
msgid ""
"**7) Power up the Solo and reconnect to controller:** Put the battery onto "
"the solo. It will just sit atop the carrier board. Obviously you should "
"avoid moving the Solo around too much at this point since the battery can "
"just fall off. So get everything situated first.  Turn on the battery.  The "
"solo will power up as usual. After a short while, the Solo will reconnect "
"with the controller as usual. It will probably give you all kinds of "
"warnings about calibration. This is normal and expected."
msgstr ""
"**7) 为 Solo 上电并重新连接遥控器：** 将电池放到 Solo 上，电池将直接放在载板顶部。由于电池可能会滑落，此时应尽量避免移动 "
"Solo。因此请先将所有东西安置好，再打开电池开关。Solo 将正常启动，片刻后 Solo "
"将与遥控器正常重连。可能会出现各种关于校准的警告，这是正常且预期的现象。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_other_install.rst:55
#: 59e40ef67f7c49cba29b9f6dca4f2d36
msgid ""
"**8) Wipe Firmware:** Use WinSCP, Filezilla, or other SFTP application as "
"described in the beginning.  Put the ``Wipe_Pixhawk_Firmware.px4`` file in "
"the **/firmware/** directory on the Solo. If there are any other ``.px4`` "
"files in this directory, delete them now, but there really shouldn't be. "
"Power cycle the solo. It will reboot, then switch into bootloader mode. "
"Normally you will see disco lights while it's doing this. But if the LED "
"driver isn't enabled, you may not. Don't worry. It's working. Give it 3-5 "
"minutes to process. You may hear some clicks as the Pixhawk reboots. After "
"3-5 minutes, you will hear some tones signalling completion. It will come "
"back to life, reconnecting with the controller."
msgstr ""
"**8）清除固件：** 如开头所述，使用WinSCP、Filezilla或其他SFTP应用。将 "
"``Wipe_Pixhawk_Firmware.px4`` 文件放入Solo的 **/firmware/** 目录。如果此目录中有其他 ``.px4``"
" "
"文件，请立即删除，但实际上不应该有。给Solo断电重启。它将重启，然后切换到引导加载程序模式。通常在此过程中可以看到彩虹灯效。但如果LED驱动未启用，可能看不到。不要担心，它正在工作中。等待3~5分钟处理完毕。您可能会听到一些Pixhawk重启时的咔嗒声。3~5分钟后，您将听到一些完成提示音。Solo将重新启动并重新连接到遥控器。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_other_install.rst:57
#: c694daa503c04c4488a9b752f8bff9e1
msgid ""
"**9) Install ArduCopter Firmware:** Use WinSCP, Filezilla, or other SFTP "
"application as described in the beginning.  Put the *ArduCopter firmware px4"
" file* (such as ``AC350_Firmware.px4``) from the zip file into the "
"**/firmware/** directory on the Solo. If there are any other px4 files in "
"this directory, delete them now, but there really shouldn't be. Power cycle "
"the solo. It will reboot, then switch into bootloader mode. Normally you "
"will see disco lights while it's doing this. But if the LED driver isn't "
"enabled, you may not. Don't worry. It's working. Give it 3-5 minutes to "
"process. You may hear some clicks as the Pixhawk reboots. After 3-5 minutes,"
" you will hear some tones signalling completion. It will come back to life, "
"reconnecting with the controller."
msgstr ""
"**9）安装ArduCopter固件：** 如开头所述，使用WinSCP、Filezilla或其他SFTP应用。将zip文件中的 "
"*ArduCopter固件px4文件* （如 ``AC350_Firmware.px4``）放入Solo的 **/firmware/** "
"目录。如果此目录中有其他px4文件，请立即删除，但实际上不应该有。给Solo断电重启。它将重启，然后切换到引导加载程序模式。通常在此过程中可以看到彩虹灯效。但如果LED驱动未启用，可能看不到。不要担心，它正在工作中。等待3~5分钟处理完毕。您可能会听到一些Pixhawk重启时的咔嗒声。3~5分钟后，您将听到一些完成提示音。Solo将重新启动并重新连接到遥控器。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_other_install.rst:59
#: cf67d75179834b4baae5dacf3d4cc4d0
msgid ""
"If the Solo doesn't seem to complete the firmware installations after about "
"5 minutes, power off the Solo and power it back on.  A few people have "
"experienced this. It took a few power cycles to get it go through. It is "
"unknown why this happens.  But in those cases, power cycling 1-4 times got "
"it to go."
msgstr ""
"如果 Solo 在约 5 分钟后似乎仍未完成固件安装，请关闭 Solo "
"后重新开机。少数用户曾遇到此情况，需要多次重启才能完成。原因尚不明确，但在这些情况下，重启 1-4 次即可解决问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_other_install.rst:61
#: 7a78fba4e1004d3db81e98fae608df02
msgid ""
"**10) Reset parameters:** Connect with Mission Planner as described in the "
"beginning. Go to Config/Tuning > Full Parameter List. Press the *Reset To "
"Defaults* button and acknowledge any prompts.  The Pixhawk will reboot.  "
"Shortly after, the controller will reconnect. You may need to reconnect "
"Mission Planner if it does not reconnect on its own."
msgstr ""
"**10）重置参数：** 如开头所述，用 Mission Planner 连接。前往Config/Tuning > Full Parameter "
"List，按 *Reset To Defaults* 按钮并确认所有提示。Pixhawk将重启。不久后遥控器将重新连接。如果 Mission "
"Planner 未自动重新连接，您可能需要手动重新连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_other_install.rst:65
#: 4d53edaa3f124c73952ca29114299459
msgid ""
"**11) Load Solo Parameters:** Connect with Mission Planner as described in "
"the beginning. Go to *Config/Tuning > Full Parameter List*. Click the *Load "
"From File* button. Select and the parameters file (``*.param``) from the zip"
" (such as ``AC350_Solo_Parameters.param``). Once the file loads, you'll "
"probably see a lot parameter boxes in Mission Planner turn green, which is "
"normal.  Next, press the *Write Params* button.  Mission Planner will write "
"all the new parameters to the Pixhawk. Once it is complete, you can "
"disconnect and close Mission Planner.  Power cycle the Solo. It will reboot "
"and reconnect to the controller. You will notice the LEDs now look like an "
"aircraft rather than a car. Installation complete!"
msgstr ""
"**11）加载 Solo 参数：** 如开头所述，用 Mission Planner 连接。前往 *Config/Tuning > Full "
"Parameter List*，点击 *Load From File* 按钮，从 zip 文件中选择参数文件（``*.param``，如 "
"``AC350_Solo_Parameters.param``）。文件加载后，Mission Planner "
"中可能会有很多参数框变为绿色，这是正常的。接下来按 *Write Params* 按钮，Mission Planner 将所有新参数写入 "
"Pixhawk。完成后，您可以断开连接并关闭 Mission Planner。给 Solo 断电重启，它将重启并重新连接遥控器。您会注意到 LED "
"现在看起来像飞行器而不是汽车。安装完成！"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_other_install.rst:67
#: 1f3466df4d1840f2ad94a6a97706f52a
msgid ""
"**12) Reassemble the Solo:** Once all of the above steps are completed "
"successfully, you can reassemble the Solo. Make sure you don't have any "
"screws left over.  Make sure all the wires, including the GPS and motor "
"pods, are plugged back in."
msgstr ""
"**12）重新组装Solo：** 以上步骤全部成功完成后，可以重新组装Solo。确保没有多余的螺丝。确保所有电线，包括GPS和电机臂，都已重新插好。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_other_install.rst:69
#: 933b63fb6a30495bb337a8542763470a
msgid ""
"**13) Connect and Check:** Turn the Solo back on. Connect with any and all "
"apps you plan to use (3DR, Solex, Side Pilot, etc) and test functionality. "
"Run the turtle/rabbit sliders for speed and pan all the way to rabbit and "
"back down all the way to turtle. These sliders make changes to the "
"parameters. Running the sliders up and down ensure those parameters are set "
"the way they should be. Go through all the settings. Touch everything to set"
" and verify everything. Do not assume these settings stuck from before."
msgstr ""
"**13）连接并检查：** 重新打开Solo。使用您计划使用的所有应用程序（3DR、Solex、Side "
"Pilot等）进行连接，并测试功能。将速度和云台的龟/兔滑块一直推到兔，然后一直拉回到龟。这些滑块会修改参数，上下拨动可确保这些参数设置正确。仔细检查所有设置，触碰每一项以设置和验证。不要假设这些设置会从之前保留下来。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_other_install.rst:71
#: ec2c31c90e8c4b9784410f110634f024
msgid ""
"**14) Calibrations:** Once all of this done, you will need to do the 3D "
"Accelerometer Calibration (aka Accel Cal, aka Level Calibration, AKA IMU "
"Calibration) and the compass calibration. Both the 3DR Solo app and Solex "
"v1.4.9 and higher has these calibrations in the menus."
msgstr ""
"**14）校准：** 完成以上所有操作后，您需要进行3D加速度计校准（即Accel Cal，也称水平校准，也称IMU校准）和罗盘校准。3DR "
"Solo应用和Solex v1.4.9及更高版本的菜单中均有这些校准选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_other_install.rst:73
#: 0c01c32d2acd4cd09140daa3d0969425
msgid ""
"Do the level calibration first on an actual level surface, such as a table. "
"For each orientation, place Solo down gently, and let it settle for about 5 "
"seconds before clicking through to the next one. It must remain perfectly "
"still when you push the button, so hands off the aircraft! Once calibration "
"is complete, you must reboot the Solo."
msgstr ""
"首先在实际平坦的表面（如桌子）上进行水平校准。每个姿态，轻轻将Solo放下，在点击下一步前静止约5秒。按下按钮时必须完全静止，手不要碰飞行器！校准完成后，必须重启Solo。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_other_install.rst:74
#: a5c7e387dd4f4fc480a621e5151baab5
msgid ""
"The compass calibration must be done outdoors in an open area, away from "
"structures, vehicles, and other metal objects. This applies to any vehicle "
"running any firmware, not just a Solo, and not just ArduCopter master. Once "
"calibration is complete, you must reboot the Solo."
msgstr ""
"罗盘校准必须在室外空旷区域进行，远离建筑物、车辆和其他金属物体。这适用于运行任何固件的任何飞行器，不仅仅是Solo，也不仅仅是ArduCopter主版本。校准完成后，必须重启Solo。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_other_install.rst:76
